<span class="ltx_personname">Tatsuki Kuribayashi
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>MBZUAI
</span>
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_email"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Email: </span><a href="mailto:"><span id="id5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">tatsuki.kuribayashi@mbzuai.ac.ae</span></a>
