<section id="A8" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix H </span>Compute Statement</h2>

<div id="A8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Most experiments presented in this paper were run on a cluster consisting of the NVIDIA H200 GPUs with 141GB of memory.
All experiments on models are run using a single 141GB memory GPU.
Evaluation time per layer differs largely on model size, with Pythia-70M, it takes approximately 1 hour, and for larger models like Gemma-2-9B, it takes approximately 4 hours per layer.
The total GPU time for this work is approximately 1400 hours, including exploratory research stage.</p>
</div>
